<title>USA: United Natl to take $0.25/shr Q1 charge.</title>
<headline>United Natl to take $0.25/shr Q1 charge.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEWATER, N.J. 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>United National Bancorp said Friday that it will record a one-time merger related charge of $1.1 million or $0.25 per share in the first quarter, related to the bank's recent acquisition of Farrington Bank of North Brunswick, New Jersey.</p>
<p>United National said the acquisition of Farrington, a $62 million asset single office bank, was completed on February 28, 1997 and is expected to have a favorable impact on United National's earnings during the remainder of 1997.</p>
</text>
